00:26:55,897 --> 00:26:58,865
Masomo ya Kijapani yanakuwaje?

470
00:26:58,888 --> 00:27:02,555
Mpangilio wa kuandika kanji ni mgumu sana.

471
00:27:02,578 --> 00:27:06,178
Unasoma kwa muda gani kila siku?

472
00:27:06,201 --> 00:27:11,934
Kila siku, nje ya masomo ya chuo, ninasoma kwa saa moja.

473
00:27:11,957 --> 00:27:14,524
Hiyo ni nzuri sana.

474
00:27:14,547 --> 00:27:19,514
Chakula gani cha Japani unachokipenda zaidi?

475
00:27:19,537 --> 00:27:23,035
Ninapenda yakitori zaidi ya vyote.

476
00:27:23,058 --> 00:27:26,791
Haswa ninapenda yakitori za chumvi.

477
00:27:26,814 --> 00:27:29,855
Chumvi inakuwa tamu sana, sivyo?

478
00:27:29,879 --> 00:27:35,355
Kila mwisho wa wiki na likizo, kwa kawaida unafanya nini?

479
00:27:35,378 --> 00:27:40,178
Kila mara ninaenda izakaya na marafiki zangu.

480
00:27:40,201 --> 00:27:44,167
Utamaduni wa izakaya nchini Japani ni wa kuvutia sana.

481
00:27:44,190 --> 00:27:47,457
Ni mahali penye shughuli nyingi na furaha, sivyo?

482
00:27:47,480 --> 00:27:51,247
Ulienda kufanya skiing wapi nchini Japani?

483
00:27:51,270 --> 00:27:54,882
Nilienda kufanya skiing kwenye milima yenye theluji huko Nagano.

484
00:27:54,905 --> 00:27:59,538
Theluji ilikuwa lainifu sana na ilikuwa bora kabisa!

485
00:27:59,561 --> 00:28:03,340
Sehemu za skiing huko Nagano ni maarufu sana.

486
00:28:03,364 --> 00:28:06,836
Ni neno gani la Kijapani unalolipenda?

487
00:28:06,860 --> 00:28:11,827
Napenda neno 'Ichigo Ichie'.

488
00:28:11,850 --> 00:28:15,461
Kwa sababu nataka kutunza kila mkutano.

489
00:28:15,484 --> 00:28:18,735
Ni neno zuri sana!

490
00:28:18,759 --> 00:28:22,226
Nini kinachofahamika zaidi nchini Australia?

491
00:28:22,249 --> 00:28:25,849
Koala na kangaruu wanajulikana sana.

492
00:28:25,872 --> 00:28:29,805
Asili yake ni pana sana.

493
00:28:29,828 --> 00:28:33,277
Ningependa kuona koala.

494
00:28:33,300 --> 00:28:37,267
Kwa siku za usoni, nini ungependa kufanya nchini Japani?

495
00:28:37,290 --> 00:28:42,657
Nataka kufanya kazi inayounganisha Japani na Australia.

496
00:28:42,680 --> 00:28:45,813
Nataka kujiunga na kampuni ya biashara ya kimataifa.

497
00:28:45,836 --> 00:28:48,069
Uwe na bidii.

498
00:28:48,092 --> 00:28:49,759
Asante sana.

499
00:28:49,782 --> 00:28:52,195
Asante sana.

500
00:28:52,218 --> 00:28:55,218
Sehemu ya 10: Mahojiano ya kujitambulisha

501
00:28:55,218 --> 00:28:56,752
Hujambo.

502
00:28:56,775 --> 00:29:00,026
Huu ndio mahojiano ya mwisho.

503
00:29:00,049 --> 00:29:02,816
Jina lako ni nani?

504
00:29:02,839 --> 00:29:04,698
Hujambo.

505
00:29:04,722 --> 00:29:07,597
Mimi ni Emma.

506
00:29:07,621 --> 00:29:09,893
Emma, basi?

507
00:29:09,916 --> 00:29:12,759
Umetoka wapi?

508
00:29:12,783 --> 00:29:16,599
Nimetoka London, Uingereza.

509
00:29:16,623 --> 00:29:19,920
Umetoka London?

510
00:29:19,944 --> 00:29:23,118
Umekaa Japani kwa muda gani?

511
00:29:23,141 --> 00:29:26,626
Nimekuwa nchini Japani kwa mwaka mmoja na nusu.

512
00:29:26,649 --> 00:29:30,082
Mwaka mmoja na nusu?

513
00:29:30,105 --> 00:29:33,472
Maisha ya Japani yanakuwaje?

514
00:29:33,495 --> 00:29:37,761
Utamaduni wa jadi wa Japani ni wa ajabu sana.

515
00:29:37,784 --> 00:29:41,584
Nina hamu ya kimono na chanoyu (chai ya Kijapani).

516
00:29:41,607 --> 00:29:44,224
Utamaduni wa Japani, basi?

517
00:29:44,248 --> 00:29:46,926
Unafanya kazi gani?

518
00:29:46,950 --> 00:29:51,800
Mimi ni mtaalamu wa makumbusho.

519
00:29:51,824 --> 00:29:55,557
Ninasoma kuhusu magundu ya Kijapani.

520
00:29:55,580 --> 00:29:59,355
Ni kazi ya kitaalamu sana!

521
00:29:59,379 --> 00:30:02,345
Una familia ya watu wangapi?

522
00:30:02,368 --> 00:30:05,602
Familia yangu ina watu watatu.

523
00:30:05,625 --> 00:30:08,358
Nina baba na mama.

524
00:30:08,381 --> 00:30:10,914
Je, wewe ni mtoto pekee?

525
00:30:10,937 --> 00:30:13,906
Ndiyo, ni hivyo.

526
00:30:13,930 --> 00:30:17,225
Masomo ya Kijapani yanakuwaje?

527
00:30:17,248 --> 00:30:22,015
Kijapani cha habari ni ngumu sana.

528
00:30:22,038 --> 00:30:27,571
Unasoma kwa muda gani kila siku?

529
00:30:27,594 --> 00:30:34,561
Nasoma gazeti kwa saa moja. Kusoma gazeti ni kiwango cha juu sana!

530
00:30:34,584 --> 00:30:39,756
Chakula gani cha Japani unachokipenda zaidi?

531
00:30:39,780 --> 00:30:44,180
Ninapenda unagi kabisa.

532
00:30:44,203 --> 00:30:47,773
Sosi yake ni tamu sana.

533
00:30:47,796 --> 00:30:50,834
Unagi ni ghali sana, sivyo?

534
00:30:50,858 --> 00:30:53,491
Ni tamu mno!

535
00:30:53,514 --> 00:30:58,522
Kila mwisho wa wiki na likizo, kwa kawaida unafanya nini?

536
00:30:58,546 --> 00:31:02,634
Ninapenda kutembea katika mitaa ya kale.

537
00:31:02,657 --> 00:31:06,590
Ninaangalia usanifu majengo wa Japani.

538
00:31:06,613 --> 00:31:09,580
Unapenda historia, sivyo?

539
00:31:09,603 --> 00:31:12,870
Jana ulienda wapi?

540
00:31:12,893 --> 00:31:17,426
Nilienda Kinkaku-ji huko Kyoto.

541
00:31:17,449 --> 00:31:21,318
Ilikuwa ya dhahabu na nzuri sana!

542
00:31:21,342 --> 00:31:24,675
Kinkaku-ji inashtua kweli, sivyo?

543
00:31:24,698 --> 00:31:29,431
Umewahi kushiriki katika sherehe za kitamaduni za Japani?

544
00:31:29,454 --> 00:31:34,389
Wiki iliyopita, nilicheza Bon Odori katika sherehe ya kiangazi.

545
00:31:34,413 --> 00:31:38,946
Nilicheza na majirani wangu, ilikuwa ya furaha sana!

546
00:31:38,969 --> 00:31:42,253
Imekuwa kumbukumbu nzuri, sivyo?

547
00:31:42,276 --> 00:31:45,610
Nini kinachofahamika zaidi nchini Uingereza?

548
00:31:45,633 --> 00:31:50,300
Mnara wa saa unaojulikana kama Big Ben ndio maarufu.

549
00:31:50,323 --> 00:31:53,770
Chai pia tunakunywa kila siku kwa wingi.

550
00:31:53,794 --> 00:31:57,892
Ningependa kunywa chai ya asili ya Uingereza.

551
00:31:57,915 --> 00:32:01,717
Kwa siku za usoni, nini ungependa kufanya nchini Japani?

552
00:32:01,740 --> 00:32:07,107
Nataka kuchapisha kitabu kinachozindua utamaduni wa Japani nchini Uingereza.

553
00:32:07,130 --> 00:32:11,201
Nataka kuendelea na utafiti zaidi.

554
00:32:11,225 --> 00:32:14,682
Ninangojea kwa hamu kitabu chako kitakapoachapishwa!

555
00:32:14,705 --> 00:32:16,923
Asante sana.

556
00:32:16,946 --> 00:32:19,985
Asante sana.